  "_comentario": "Boss catalogue reusable across arcs. Same schema as a character: statsBase, jutsu, modos (array, 0-2 transformations activated only by level, never mid-combat). BALANCE: boss/mini-boss statsBase is calculated as a fixed multiple of an average character (hp41/atk9/def7/spd8) — mini-boss: x1.8 hp, x1.3 atk/def, x1.2 spd. boss: x2.2 hp, x1.5 atk, x1.4 def, x1.2 spd. Since player and enemy scale with the same formula per level, the ratio stays constant at any point of the run. Each arc references the ids it needs via miniJefeId/jefeFinalId in its config. Each boss also has 'rareza' and 'curvaXp': this lets the same object serve as personajeBase if unlocked as recruitable via achievement (desbloqueablePorLogro: true) — no need to duplicate it in characters.json.",
